  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>If a prim exists in the link set at <b>link</b>, set <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> diffuse <b>texture</b> on <b>face</b> of that prim.</p>
</p>
